graph TD
    Start([Create/Update Collection Request]) --> Check{SDK Provides<br/>Compression Config?}
    
    Check -->|Yes| Validate[Validate & Adjust<br/>SDK Config]
    Check -->|No| ServerDefaults{Check Server<br/>Engine Defaults}
    
    Validate --> Apply[Apply Compression<br/>Configuration]
    
    ServerDefaults -->|VIPER| ViperDefault[VIPER Defaults:<br/>ZSTD Level 3<br/>Adaptive=true<br/>MinRatio=1.5]
    ServerDefaults -->|SST| SstDefault[SST Defaults:<br/>ZSTD Level 3<br/>Adaptive=false<br/>MinRatio=1.5]
    ServerDefaults -->|None| NoCompression[No Compression]
    
    ViperDefault --> Apply
    SstDefault --> Apply
    NoCompression --> Apply
    
    Apply --> Hints{Check Storage<br/>Optimization Hints}
    
    Hints -->|Archive Pattern| MaxCompression[ZSTD Level 9<br/>Maximum Compression]
    Hints -->|Write Heavy| FastCompression[LZ4<br/>Fast Compression]
    Hints -->|Read Heavy<br/>Dense Data| NoComp[No Compression<br/>for Low Latency]
    Hints -->|Sparse Data| HighCompression[ZSTD Level 6<br/>High Compression]
    Hints -->|Balanced| BalancedComp[ZSTD Level 3<br/>Balanced]
    
    MaxCompression --> Store[(Store in<br/>Collection Metadata)]
    FastCompression --> Store
    NoComp --> Store
    HighCompression --> Store
    BalancedComp --> Store

    style Start fill:#e1f5fe
    style Apply fill:#c8e6c9
    style Store fill:#ffecb3